            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Отобрази переменную <code>temps_list</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temps = \" /><text value=\"&quot;34 23 44&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temps_list = temps.split()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temps_list)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"65\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['34', '23', '44']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Обязательно выбери <code>print(temps_list)</code>.</p></body></html>"
